@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: Marketplace site
	Frontend testing for the Marketplace site

Scenario: View app marketplace page
	End users should be able to view the app marketplace page.

	Given I should be able to view the marketplace page with the relative url "web/marketplace"

Scenario: View solutions marketplace page
	End users should be able to view the solutions marketplace page.

	Given I should be able to view the marketplace page with the relative url "web/marketplace/solutions"